WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.536 --> 00:00:18.116
do you mean?"

2
00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:19.437
Zann asked Gliss.

3
00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:22.039
"What did you find out while you were a prisoner?"

4
00:00:22.059 --> 00:00:23.881
"Is it something about Morb?"

5
00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:24.721
Darb asked.

6
00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:26.783
Gliss' lower lip trembled.

7
00:00:27.163 --> 00:00:28.364
"Yes," she said.

8
00:00:28.384 --> 00:00:30.286
"And it's horrible!"

9
00:00:30.946 --> 00:00:32.668
"Tell us," Perda urged.

10
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.901
"A few of the other Reds understood the trolls' language," Gliss said.

11
00:00:37.921 --> 00:00:41.582
"They listened when our guards talked to one another.

12
00:00:41.602 --> 00:00:47.104
The trolls kept grumbling about having to keep us at the zoo instead of zapping us back to

13
00:00:47.144 --> 00:00:48.084
Morb's fortress."

14
00:00:48.104 --> 00:00:51.125
"We were wondering about that too," Darb said.

15
00:00:51.965 --> 00:00:52.646
Zann nodded.

16
00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:57.947
"We guessed it might be because Morb used up all his power kidnapping the king and queen."

17
00:00:57.967 --> 00:01:01.128
"That's not why," Gliss said.

18
00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:05.005
"Kidnapping the king and queen gave Morb even more power.

19
00:01:05.745 --> 00:01:11.007
He left the trolls alone because he's busy building a horrible machine to steal all of the magical

20
00:01:11.087 --> 00:01:12.367
energy in Magica!"

21
00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:13.787
Perda gasped.

22
00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.268
"What? That's impossible!"

23
00:01:16.288 --> 00:01:19.389
"That's what I thought at first," Gliss said.

24
00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:22.290
"I figured the trolls must be confused.

25
00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.590
Everyone knows they're pretty dumb.

26
00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.491
But then I talked to a woman named Saffa."

27
00:01:27.511 --> 00:01:32.036
"She's one of Boz's Magic Master friends," Zann said.

28
00:01:32.056 --> 00:01:33.777
"What did she say?"

29
00:01:33.797 --> 00:01:38.920
"Saffa knows about an ancient text from the Old Times," Gliss replied.

30
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:44.944
"It contains plans for building a machine that could do what the trolls said— suck the power out

31
00:01:45.044 --> 00:01:49.907
of Reds, regular people, dragons, message moths, mood trees, whatever.

32
00:01:50.767 --> 00:01:53.469
Anything or anyone with any magic at all."

33
00:01:54.469 --> 00:01:55.130
Zann gulped.

34
00:01:55.150 --> 00:02:01.774
"So if Morb succeeded in building this machine, he would control all the magic in Magica?"

35
00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:03.135
Gliss nodded.

36
00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:06.637
"Saffa said the Old Times ended because of that machine.

37
00:02:07.378 --> 00:02:13.722
An extremely powerful and evil magician invented it, and when people realized what the machine could do, they

38
00:02:13.742 --> 00:02:14.403
were shocked.

39
00:02:15.163 --> 00:02:21.488
People decided no one person should have that much power, and that Magica needed laws to protect the

40
00:02:21.528 --> 00:02:22.729
weak from the strong."

41
00:02:22.749 --> 00:02:26.952
"That was when the first Red Council was formed," Darb put in.

42
00:02:27.668 --> 00:02:30.631
"The first thing the members did was enact the Days of Discipline.

43
00:02:31.311 --> 00:02:35.055
I've read a lot about that—but I've never heard of the magic-sucking machine."

44
00:02:35.075 --> 00:02:38.618
"How could Morb get his hands on those plans?"

45
00:02:39.078 --> 00:02:39.719
Zann wondered.

46
00:02:39.739 --> 00:02:44.303
"Teplo says all the ancient texts are locked away at the university."

47
00:02:44.323 --> 00:02:51.249
"Saffa suspects there's another copy of the text hidden deep within the Cave of the Unknown," Gliss said.

48
00:02:51.269 --> 00:02:53.911
"How would Morb have found it?"

49
00:02:54.231 --> 00:02:54.852
Perda asked.

50
00:02:55.644 --> 00:03:00.067
"Even the most powerful Magic Masters don't dare go too deep in there."

51
00:03:00.447 --> 00:03:01.167
Gliss shrugged.

52
00:03:01.988 --> 00:03:02.728
"Who knows?

53
00:03:03.168 --> 00:03:05.549
But if he did Her voice trailed off.

54
00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:09.111
For a moment the kids all stared at one another in silence.

55
00:03:09.892 --> 00:03:11.112
Zann was the first to speak.

56
00:03:11.132 --> 00:03:12.853
"We have to warn somebody.

57
00:03:13.554 --> 00:03:17.596
If this is true, Morb needs to be stopped before it's too late."

58
00:03:17.616 --> 00:03:20.918
"Let's go to the palace," Perda said.

59
00:03:20.938 --> 00:03:23.679
"Yog will be able to get word to Venna from there."

60
00:03:23.699 --> 00:03:25.845
"Wait!" Gliss broke in.

61
00:03:25.865 --> 00:03:28.226
"Let's just wait for Fala to get back.

62
00:03:29.147 --> 00:03:31.789
She's not a Red—it's safer for her to go."

63
00:03:31.809 --> 00:03:37.833
"But if Morb really is working on this magic-sucking machine, there's no time to waste!"

64
00:03:38.153 --> 00:03:38.693
Perda said.

65
00:03:39.534 --> 00:03:40.795
Zann knew that Perda was right.

66
00:03:41.776 --> 00:03:45.838
But he still felt guilty about convincing Gliss to zap out of the palace earlier.

67
00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:49.441
He didn't want to talk her into something else that could be dangerous.

68
00:03:49.461 --> 00:03:52.543
"Why don't you stay here while the rest of us go?"

69
00:03:52.923 --> 00:03:53.544
he suggested.

70
00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.901
"You can tell Fala where we went."

71
00:03:56.662 --> 00:03:58.023
"No!" Gliss said.

72
00:03:58.043 --> 00:04:00.284
"If you're all going, I'm going too."

73
00:04:00.304 --> 00:04:02.526
"Okay," Zann agreed.

74
00:04:02.926 --> 00:04:04.727
Obviously Gliss didn't want to be alone.

75
00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.252
It didn't take long for Zann and his friends to reach the palace.

76
00:04:12.053 --> 00:04:15.855
A stout man with a bristly brown beard was standing guard at the main entrance.

77
00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:19.578
"No visitors," he said without even looking at the kids.

78
00:04:19.598 --> 00:04:22.360
"Official business only today."

79
00:04:23.168 --> 00:04:26.330
"We are here on official business," Perda said.

80
00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.531
"We need to talk to Yog.

81
00:04:28.852 --> 00:04:29.492
Or Rixa."

82
00:04:30.212 --> 00:04:32.254
The guard glanced at her, looking skeptical.

83
00:04:32.274 --> 00:04:34.115
"What's your business?"

84
00:04:34.135 --> 00:04:39.598
"Please, just tell Yog or Rixa that we're here," Zann said.

85
00:04:40.699 --> 00:04:43.841
The guard's jaw dropped as he noticed Zann's hair color.

86
00:04:44.661 --> 00:04:46.182
"Reds!" he exclaimed.

87
00:04:46.202 --> 00:04:48.944
"What did you say your names were again?"

88
00:04:49.896 --> 00:04:53.279
Zann and his friends waited impatiently while the guard sent a message moth.

89
00:04:54.079 --> 00:04:56.261
Soon the moth returned with a new message.

90
00:04:57.061 --> 00:04:57.762
The guard read it.

91
00:04:58.302 --> 00:05:00.043
"Rixa says to let you in.

92
00:05:00.984 --> 00:05:03.306
You'll find her in the throne room with Slib."

93
00:05:04.466 --> 00:05:07.068
Zann wondered if that meant Slib had taken over the government.

94
00:05:07.088 --> 00:05:08.929
"Thanks," he said.

95
00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:13.413
He and his friends hurried inside before the guard could change his mind about letting them in.

96
00:05:17.335 --> 00:05:18.096
Then they stopped.

97
00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.621
"Do you remember how to get to the throne room?"

98
00:05:21.002 --> 00:05:21.562
Gliss asked.

99
00:05:22.282 --> 00:05:23.003
"How could I?

100
00:05:23.403 --> 00:05:25.484
We crawled in through a tunnel and zapped out."

101
00:05:26.265 --> 00:05:27.986
Perda glanced up and down the hallway.

102
00:05:28.006 --> 00:05:29.727
"Wait, is that it?"

103
00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:34.649
The kids could see a large, arched doorway farther down the hall, and they hurried to it.

104
00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.911
Zann peered in and saw a large crowd of adults.

105
00:05:37.931 --> 00:05:40.433
"Do you see Rixa or Yog?"

106
00:05:40.733 --> 00:05:41.353
Gliss whispered.

107
00:05:42.114 --> 00:05:43.514
Zann couldn't see Yog anywhere.

108
00:05:44.135 --> 00:05:46.076
But he spotted Rixa arguing with Slib.

109
00:05:46.592 --> 00:05:50.153
Before he could point her out, a burst of magical energy filled the room.

110
00:05:50.934 --> 00:05:56.176
Morb appeared in front of the thrones—along with half a dozen trolls and a cloud of tiny, buzzing

111
00:05:56.216 --> 00:06:00.197
dragons. Thinking fast, Zann pulled his friends out of sight.

112
00:06:01.058 --> 00:06:02.398
His heart pounded with fear.

113
00:06:03.159 --> 00:06:04.839
Had Morb tracked them here somehow?

114
00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:07.460
Morb didn't even glance in their direction though.

115
00:06:08.141 --> 00:06:10.542
He stared at the stunned adults with a smile.

116
00:06:10.562 --> 00:06:12.923
"Hello again," he said.

117
00:06:12.943 --> 00:06:16.224
"I liked it here so much that I decided to return."

118
00:06:17.025 --> 00:06:19.434
He stepped over to the king's throne and sat down.

119
00:06:19.454 --> 00:06:22.346
"And this time I think I'll stay."
